abstract: "A local research instrument for scoped decision packets, source-bound quantities, assessed experimental units, conditional assay uncertainty, process trajectories, historical reconstruction and evolving-evidence reassessment. Claim Review remains separate; literature receipts preserve unresolved scope. Evaluated on synthetic fixtures, without laboratory or industrial validation."
